From: nixos-dotfiles
Subject: Adapt imhexMCP for ImHex 1.38.1 OpenResult API

Upstream patch 0002 does not apply to 1.38.1 (open() now returns OpenResult,
and open(bool) was still private). This replaces it with:
- LIBRARY_PLUGIN for builtin so the MCP plugin can link FileProvider
- public open(bool directAccess)
- graceful settings handling for network/MCP opens
- OpenResult-aware error reporting in the MCP plugin

